REGION
id:newsroll
width:40%
lines:3
regionanchor:0%,100%
viewportanchor:0%,100%
scroll:up

REGION
id:stationary
width:36%
lines:2
regionanchor:100%,0%
viewportanchor:100%,0%

STYLE
::cue {
  background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.0), rgba(0,0,0,0.65));
  color: white;
  font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
  font-size: 5vh;
  line-height: 5.33vh;
}
::cue(.emph) {
  color: #ffd23f;
  font-weight: bold;
}
::cue(.dim) {
  color: #b8c0cc;
  font-style: italic;
}
::cue(.fixedpx) {
  font-size: 28px;
  line-height: 30px;
}
::cue-region(newsroll) {
  background: rgba(12, 18, 28, 0.72);
}

NOTE
This block intentionally mixes region cues, free cues, overlaps and wrapping.

